{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/reactingtonexusevents"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReactingToNexusEvents","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Reacting to Nexus events","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Observe structural changes and, on request, changes of component values."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","type":"reference"},{"text":" reports what happens to its entities, components and families to its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/delegate","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Structural events are always delivered:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityCreated","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityDestroyed","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentAdded","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentRemoved","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/FamilyMemberAdded","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/FamilyMemberRemoved","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Value change events are opt-in:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentReplaced"},{"text":": a component was set on an entity that already had one of that type.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentModified"},{"type":"text","text":": a component of one entity was changed in place."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified"},{"text":": a bulk write pass changed the components of a type. One event per pass, not one per entity; ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified\/count","isActive":true},{"text":" is the number of components the pass could write.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every event names its entity with the generational ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityIdentifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", so a stale identifier never matches a later entity in the same slot.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Subscribing","text":"Subscribing","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate\/subscribedEvents","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/structural"},{"type":"text","text":" by default. Return "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/valueChanges"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/all","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to receive value changes:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["final class Observer: NexusEventDelegate {","    var subscribedEvents: NexusEventMask { .all }","","    func nexusEvent(_ event: NexusEvent) {","        switch event {","        case let added as ComponentAdded:","            print(\"added\", added.component, \"to\", added.toEntity)","        case let modified as ComponentModified:","            print(\"modified\", modified.component, \"of\", modified.entityId)","        default:","            break","        }","    }","","    func nexusNonFatalError(_ message: String) {}","}","","nexus.delegate = observer"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","type":"reference"},{"text":" is an open protocol and later releases add events. Always switch with a ","type":"text"},{"code":"default:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" case."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The nexus reads ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subscribedEvents"},{"text":" once, when the delegate is assigned. After changing the subscription, assign the delegate again: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nexus.delegate = observer"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/structural","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is informational. Structural events are always delivered, as in FirebladeECS 1, also to a delegate whose mask does not contain it."}]}]}]},{"level":3,"text":"Cost","type":"heading","anchor":"Cost"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With the default mask a write to a component costs one branch on a flag the nexus caches, and nothing else: the delegate is not called and no event is created."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Ordering","anchor":"Ordering"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Modifying a component that is missing, with a default value, delivers "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentAdded","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and then "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentModified","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Setting a component the entity does not have yet delivers "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentAdded","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" only, never "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentReplaced","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Setting a component the entity already has replaces it and delivers "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentReplaced","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to delegates that subscribed to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/valueChanges","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Comparison with flecs","anchor":"Comparison-with-flecs"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"flecs observers (OnAdd, OnRemove, OnSet) fire on an actual add or remove, and OnSet fires on every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"set"},{"type":"text","text":" and on an explicit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"modified()"},{"type":"text","text":" call, but not on direct writes through a pointer. Setting a missing component fires OnAdd and then OnSet. Observers cost nothing while none exist."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"FirebladeECS differs on purpose: in-place writes through the nexus emit ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentModified","type":"reference"},{"text":" automatically, so there is no ","type":"text"},{"code":"modified()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call to forget, and setting a missing component emits ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentAdded","type":"reference"},{"text":" only.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Benchmarks","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind"]}],"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/ReadingAndWritingComponents":{"role":"article","type":